Date: Sun, 18 Oct 2026 18:01:01 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 098/202] [ae-patch] Put the rail's Absorbed and Unfiled counts
 side by side

The Triage card gave each count a row of its own, which left the card a row
taller than it needs to be (Reid, 2026-10-18). The two counts now share one
row of two columns. Opening one shades it and lists its lines full width
below the row; one list is open at a time.
